# Tracker

Use the configured tracker as the source of issue state when tracker-first workflow is enabled.

## Must use

- `.ai/linear-scope.json`
- `.ai/rules/linear-mcp.mdc`
- `.ai/reference/tracker-degraded-mode.md`
- `.agents/runtime/orchestrator-state.mjs` when the issue is orchestrator-managed

## Rules

- do not mix foreign team/project scopes
- degraded mode must be explicit, not silent
- keep tracker phase transitions aligned with plan-ready, active execution, and review-ready states
